{"date":"2026-10-10","level":"n4_lite","title":"はじめての乗馬体験","text":"先月、友達に誘われてはじめて乗馬体験に行ってみた。馬は思っていたより大きくて、最初は少し怖かった。でも係の人が乗り方を優しく教えてくれたので、少しずつ慣れることができた。馬の上から見る景色はとても気持ちよくて、またやってみたいと思った。","tokens":[{"surface_form":"先月","basic_form":"先月","reading":"せんげつ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"友達","basic_form":"友達","reading":"ともだち","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"誘われて","basic_form":"誘う","reading":"さそわれて","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"はじめて","basic_form":"はじめて","reading":"はじめて","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"乗馬体験","basic_form":"乗馬体験","reading":"じょうばたいけん","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"行ってみた","basic_form":"行く","reading":"いってみた","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"馬","basic_form":"馬","reading":"うま","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"は","basic_form":"は","reading":"は","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"思っていた","basic_form":"思う","reading":"おもっていた","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"より","basic_form":"より","reading":"より","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"大きくて","basic_form":"大きい","reading":"おおきくて","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"最初","basic_form":"最初","reading":"さいしょ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"は","basic_form":"は","reading":"は","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"少し","basic_form":"少し","reading":"すこし","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"怖かった","basic_form":"怖い","reading":"こわかった","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"でも","basic_form":"でも","reading":"でも","pos":"接続詞"},{"surface_form":"係","basic_form":"係","reading":"かかり","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"の","basic_form":"の","reading":"の","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"人","basic_form":"人","reading":"ひと","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"が","basic_form":"が","reading":"が","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"乗り方","basic_form":"乗り方","reading":"のりかた","pos":"名詞